k:hover .mv-create-jtr-caret,.mv-create-jtr-link:focus .mv-create-jtr-caret{fill:#666}.mv-create-jtr-button-uppercase{text-transform:uppercase}</style><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Get a taste of mom&rsquo;s home cooking with this Dutch Oven Lasagna. This hearty one-pot meal is easy to make out at the campground.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p><div class="wp-block-image"><figure class="aligncenter size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-nopin="true" src="https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Close-up-of-Dutch-Oven-Lasagna-made-while-camping.jpg" alt="Close up of Dutch Oven Lasagna made while camping" class="wp-image-17842" srcset="https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Close-up-of-Dutch-Oven-Lasagna-made-while-camping.jpg 1200w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Close-up-of-Dutch-Oven-Lasagna-made-while-camping-300x200.jpg 300w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Close-up-of-Dutch-Oven-Lasagna-made-while-camping-768x512.jpg 768w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Close-up-of-Dutch-Oven-Lasagna-made-while-camping-960x640.jpg 960w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Close-up-of-Dutch-Oven-Lasagna-made-while-camping-1080x720.jpg 1080w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Close-up-of-Dutch-Oven-Lasagna-made-while-camping-150x100.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-pin-media="https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Close-up-of-Dutch-Oven-Lasagna-made-while-camping.jpg"></figure></div><p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Lasagna is not a meal you think of when you think of camping. We camp often and are looking for variety, so I wanted to try it out.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">This meal requires minimal prep other than browning the meat. Other&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Lodge-Seasoned-Cast-Iron-Dutch/dp/B00008GKDW/ref=as_li_ss_tl?ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1509977326&amp;sr=8-11&amp;keywords=dutch+oven&amp;linkCode=ll1&amp;tag=letscampsmore-20&amp;linkId=def7f736f51b9ef9301636855d90368d" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener sponsored nofollow"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">Dutch ov</span>en</a>&nbsp;meals with easy prep include&nbsp;Chicken&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;veggies and <a href="https://letscampsmore.com/dutch-oven-pizza/">Pizza</a>.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading is-style-dutch-heading">Dutch Oven Lasagna Recipe</h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">I love using pre-made ingredients, and this recipe is no exception. The ingredients are:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li>Ground meat of choice</li><li><em>Optional: chopped onion, sliced mushrooms</em></li><li>Pasta sauce &ndash; 2 jars</li><li>Oven-ready lasagna noodles</li><li>Ricotta cheese</li><li>Italian seasoning</li><li>Shredded mozzarella or Italian cheese</li><li><em>Optional: grated Parmesan cheese</em></li></ul><p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p><div class="wp-block-image"><figure class="aligncenter size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="850" height="540" data-pin-nopin="true" src="https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Easy-Lasagna-Ingredients.jpg" alt="Easy Lasagna Ingredients" class="wp-image-18806" srcset="https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Easy-Lasagna-Ingredients.jpg 850w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Easy-Lasagna-Ingredients-300x191.jpg 300w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Easy-Lasagna-Ingredients-768x488.jpg 768w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Easy-Lasagna-Ingredients-150x95.jpg 150w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 850px) 100vw, 850px" data-pin-media="https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Easy-Lasagna-Ingredients.jpg"></figure></div><p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p><h2 class="wp-block-heading">How to Make Lasagna in a Dutch Oven</h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Yes, with most <a href="https://letscampsmore.com/dutch-oven-camping-recipes/">Dutch oven recipes</a>, you start by preparing coals. I have an <a href="https://www.amazon.com/Lodge-Seasoned-Cast-Iron-Dutch/dp/B00008GKDW/ref=as_li_ss_tl?ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1509977326&amp;sr=8-11&amp;keywords=dutch+oven&amp;linkCode=ll1&amp;tag=letscampsmore-20&amp;linkId=def7f736f51b9ef9301636855d90368d" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener sponsored nofollow">eight-quart cast-iron Dutch oven</a>, so I prepare 25+ charcoal briquettes.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">You can prepare the ground meat ahead of time or cook it in a Dutch oven over a campfire.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">We browned our protein with chopped onion and sliced mushroom.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">The only preparation needed for the pasta sauce is to open the jars. Since the pot gets wider as you layer, use less sauce on the bottom and more on the top.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">It is essential to use oven-ready lasagna noodles in this recipe. They eliminate the need to boil the noodles before assembling, and the sauce&rsquo;s liquid helps soften them.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Prepare the cheese filling by combining ricotta cheese with Italian seasoning. I mixed ours at home and brought it out in a plastic container.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Package shredded cheese is perfect for this recipe. Look for mozzarella or an Italian blend.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Now, it is time to assemble. Layer the lasagna in the following order:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li>Sauce</li><li>Noodles</li><li>Sauce</li><li>Meat mix</li><li>Ricotta mix</li><li>Shredded cheese</li><li>Sauce</li><li>Noodles</li><li>Sauce</li><li>Meat mixture</li><li>Ricotta</li><li>Shredded cheese</li><li>Parmesan cheese</li></ul><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Cover the Dutch oven, and place 17 coals on the lid. Place the entire pot over a circle of eight coals.</p><p class="has-text-align-center has-theme-palette-8-background-color has-background wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Dutch Oven Tip</strong><br>The number of coals will vary by the size of your oven. <em><a href="https://www.lodgecastiron.com/story/how-many-coals-use-when-cooking-with-a-camp-dutch-oven" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">See chart</a></em> <br>Prepare extra briquettes to replace spots that get cold.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Bake the lasagna for 30 minutes, rotating the lid and pot a quarter turn in opposite directions every 10 minutes.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">The lasagna is done when the cheese is melted and the noodles are cooked. If needed, add 5-10 minutes.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">These simple ingredients elevate when cooked in a cast-iron pot. Serve the pasta with a side of vegetables and <a href="https://letscampsmore.com/dutch-oven-bread/">baked bread</a>.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p><div class="wp-block-image"><figure class="aligncenter size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="682" height="1200" data-pin-nopin="true" src="https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/A-serving-of-camping-lasagna-with-green-beans-and-some-bread-682x1200.jpg" alt="A serving of camping lasagna with green beans and some bread" class="wp-image-17841" srcset="https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/A-serving-of-camping-lasagna-with-green-beans-and-some-bread-682x1200.jpg 682w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/A-serving-of-camping-lasagna-with-green-beans-and-some-bread-170x300.jpg 170w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/A-serving-of-camping-lasagna-with-green-beans-and-some-bread-768x1352.jpg 768w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/A-serving-of-camping-lasagna-with-green-beans-and-some-bread-545x960.jpg 545w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/A-serving-of-camping-lasagna-with-green-beans-and-some-bread-614x1080.jpg 614w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/A-serving-of-camping-lasagna-with-green-beans-and-some-bread-150x264.jpg 150w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/A-serving-of-camping-lasagna-with-green-beans-and-some-bread.jpg 800w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 682px) 100vw, 682px" data-pin-media="https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/A-serving-of-camping-lasagna-with-green-beans-and-some-bread.jpg"></figure></div><p class="wp-block-paragraph">This Dutch Oven Lasagna was so delicious that we devoured it. The two of us ate nearly the entire thing in one sitting.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>More Hearty Camping Dinners</strong></p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><a href="https://letscampsmore.com/dutch-oven-salisbury-steak/">Dutch Oven Salisbury Steak</a></li><li><a href="https://letscampsmore.com/camping-skillet-bbq/">BBQ Sweet Potato Skillet</a></li><li><a href="https://letscampsmore.com/camping-tacos/">Camping Tacos</a></li><li><a href="https://letscampsmore.com/dutch-oven-mac-and-cheese/">Dutch Oven Mac &amp; Cheese</a></li></ul><p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p><div class="wp-block-image"><figure class="aligncenter size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="1200" data-pin-description="Experience the comfort of homemade cooking with this Dutch Oven Lasagna. This satisfying one-pot dish is simple to prepare." data-pin-title="Easy Dutch Oven Lasagna Recipe" src="https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Lasagna-made-in-a-Dutch-Oven-800x1200.jpg" alt="Lasagna in a Dutch Oven" class="wp-image-17846" srcset="https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Lasagna-made-in-a-Dutch-Oven-800x1200.jpg 800w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Lasagna-made-in-a-Dutch-Oven-200x300.jpg 200w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Lasagna-made-in-a-Dutch-Oven-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Lasagna-made-in-a-Dutch-Oven-640x960.jpg 640w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Lasagna-made-in-a-Dutch-Oven-720x1080.jpg 720w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Lasagna-made-in-a-Dutch-Oven-150x225.jpg 150w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Lasagna-made-in-a-Dutch-Oven-735x1103.jpg 735w, https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Lasagna-made-in-a-Dutch-Oven.jpg 1000w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" data-pin-media="https://spcdn.shortpixel.ai/spio/ret_img,q_cdnize,to_webp,s_webp/letscampsmore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Lasagna-made-in-a-Dutch-Oven.jpg"></figure></div><p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p><div id="mv-creation-92-jtr-hint-wrapper" class="mv-create-jtr-hint-wrapper"><div id="mv-creation-92-jtr" class="mv-pre-create-target"><div class="mv-create-jtr-continue" style="display:none"><a href="#mv-creation-92" class="mv-create-jtr mv-create-jtr-link mv-create-jtr-button-uppercase"><svg class="mv-create-jtr-caret" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 444.819 444.819" width="16px" height="16px"><path d="M434.252,114.203l-21.409-21.416c-7.419-7.04-16.084-10.561-25.975-10.561c-10.095,0-18.657,3.521-25.7,10.561 L222.41,231.549L83.653,92.791c-7.042-7.04-15.606-10.561-25.697-10.561c-9.896,0-18.559,3.521-25.979,10.561l-21.128,21.416 C3.615,121.436,0,130.099,0,140.188c0,10.277,3.619,18.842,10.848,25.693l185.864,185.865c6.855,7.23,15.416,10.848,25.697,10.848 c10.088,0,18.75-3.617,25.977-10.848l185.865-185.865c7.043-7.044,10.567-15.608,10.567-25.693 C444.819,130.287,441.295,121.629,434.252,114.203z"></path></svg> Continue to Content</a></div></div> <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"http:\/\/schema.org","@type":"Recipe","name":"Dutch Oven Lasagna","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Let's Camp S'more"},"datePublished":"2023-07-19","recipeYield":6,"description":"Experience the comfort of homemade cooking with this Dutch Oven Lasagna. This satisfying one-pot dish is simple to prepare.","image":["https:\/\/letscampsmore.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Easy-Camping-Lasagna-in-a-Dutch-Oven-Recipe-720x720.jpg","https:\/\/letscampsmore.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Easy-Camping-Lasagna-in-a-Dutch-Oven-Recipe-720x540.jpg","https:\/\/letscampsmore.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Easy-Camping-Lasagna-in-a-Dutch-Oven-Recipe-540x720.jpg","https:\/\/letscampsmore.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Easy-Camping-Lasagna-in-a-Dutch-Oven-Recipe-720x405.jpg","https:\/\/letscampsmore.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/Easy-Camping-Lasagna-in-a-Dutch-Oven-Recipe-735x735.jpg"],"recipeCategory":"Dutch Oven","prepTime":"PT30M","cookTime":"PT30M","performTime":"PT40M","totalTime":"PT10M","recipeIngredient":["1-2 pounds ground meat of choice","Optional: 1 chopped onion, 1 cup sliced mushrooms","2 jars pasta sauce ","Oven-ready lasagna noodles","1 container ricotta cheese"," 1\u00bd TBSP Italian seasoning ","1\u00bd - 2 cups shredded mozzarella or Italian cheese","Optional: grated Parmesan cheese"],"recipeInstructions":[{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Prepare coals. I have an eight-quart cast-iron Dutch oven, so I light 25+ charcoal briquettes.","position":1,"name":"Prepare coals. I have an eight-quart cast-iron Dutch...","url":"https:\/\/letscampsmore.com\/dutch-oven-lasagna\/#mv_create_92_1"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Brown the ground meat at home ahead of time, or cook it in the Dutch oven over a campfire. We add chopped onion and sliced mushrooms while cooking the meat.","position":2,"name":"Brown the ground meat at home ahead of...","url":"https:\/\/letscampsmore.com\/dutch-oven-lasagna\/#mv_create_92_2"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Prepare the cheese filling by combining ricotta cheese with Italian seasoning.","position":3,"name":"Prepare the cheese filling by combining ricotta cheese...","url":"https:\/\/letscampsmore.com\/dutch-oven-lasagna\/#mv_create_92_3"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Assemble the lasagna in the order shown below.","position":4,"name":"Assemble the lasagna in the order shown below.","url":"https:\/\/letscampsmore.com\/dutch-oven-lasagna\/#mv_create_92_4"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Cover the Dutch oven, and put 